  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Caritas Africa Programme Costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support Caritas organizations in Africa in the implementation of their Strategic and Operational Plan 2008, specific to their programme work. It will enable Caritas Africa to enhance governance structures and increase self-reliance of their member organizations, in the aim for stronger impact in the area of advocacy and campaign for social and environmental justice, emergency response, rehabilitation and development.</narrative>
  </description>
